license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible community release of the 314.7B-parameter Motif-3 sparse-MoE
  core model as an 83.56 GiB mixed IQ2_XXS GGUF, with a pinned llama.cpp
  runtime, DGX Spark measurements, tokenizer parity evidence, and explicit
  quality-retention boundaries.
keywords:
  - Motif-3
  - DGX Spark
  - GGUF
  - llama.cpp
  - quantization
  - mixture of experts
